Here's what you can ask this system to do by email:

- Email a .vtt transcript file to have it added to your group's records. Mention which group
  it's for if you belong to more than one.
- The system can access Trello cards (if added), GitHub repos (if added) and any meetings
  that the group have had. You can email and ask for specific information about any of these
  sources of information. It's helpful to specify a timeframe for your query to make the
  response more targeted. If further clarification is need, the system will reply and ask 
  for it
- Reply to a meeting summary to add a comment. Keep `group_id=7 meeting_id=42` in the subject
  (using the actual IDs) and put the comment in the reply body.

Audio recordings aren't accepted by email - please contact the admin to have those added
directly.
